     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi all,</div><div><br></div><div>Just an FYI so y&#39;all aren&#39;t baffled when trying to rerun code with new versions of R and finding you have different values in spite of setting the seed.</div><div><br></div><div>R version 3.6.0 is due for release on Friday 26 April 2019 and has a new default algorithm for the &#39;sample&#39; family of functions. This will affect the following AHMbook functions, which will no longer return the same values for a given seed:</div><div><ul style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><li>Chapter 9 : sim.spatialDS, sim.spatialHDS</li><li>Chapter 10 : wigglyOcc</li><li>Chapter 21 : simPPe, simDataDK</li><li>Chapter 22 : sim.spatialDSline</li></ul><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">To recreate the values used in the book, run<span> </span><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">RNGkind(sample.kind = &quot;Rounding&quot;)</font><span> </span>before setting the seed. That call will throw an error with versions prior to 3.6.0, so if including it in a script use</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">if(getRversion() &gt;= &quot;3.6.0&quot;)</font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">  RNGkind(sample.kind = &quot;Rounding&quot;)</font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">This has all arisen because the old (&quot;Rounding&quot;) algorithm does not in fact sample uniformly for large numbers, and that needed to be fixed. The new default (&quot;Rejection&quot;) is correct, so that&#39;s the one to use unless you really need the old one to reproduce previous values.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">Regards, Mike<br></div><br></div></div>"
    ]
